# Always push after code changes

When you make any code update or modification in this project:

1. Commit the relevant changes with a clear message (why, not just what).
2. Immediately push to `origin` on the current branch (`git push -u origin HEAD` if needed).
3. Do this without waiting for the user to ask “push хийсэн үү?” — push is required by default for this repo.
4. Repo lives in the `GIT/` folder (`https://github.com/nbaenkhbat-create/SmartExam.git`).
5. Still never force-push to main/master, never skip hooks, and never commit secrets (`.env`, API keys, credentials).
